{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make networks of walking, biking, road and train paths, all of which can cross each other by simply removing a tile after vehicles were spawned prior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433840/extras/crossing.png?t=1741749448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replace land with light water, light water with landfill and build bridges over light water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433840/extras/bridging.png?t=1741749448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch rockets that turn into money making satellites.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433840/extras/rocketlaunch.png?t=1741749448\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Current Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">base world known as Severa</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 vehicle types, 3 in early, mid and late game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 songs, including the main menu and credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">hotkeys / buttons For redundancy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">research upgrades with quantum research building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">human resources / alien resources system for progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a simple order system</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433840?t=1741749448","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433840?t=1741749448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433840/fdd5756c0a7ceaccceca8ba92b1d21dba0c39027/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741749448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams